{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>在粉嶺皇后山的緬甸線（Burma Line）啹喀廟，旁邊的一座小鐵皮廟，今日（13日） 被發現遭燒毀。記者現場所見，鐵皮廟變化一片灰燼，神像都被燒到焦黑，暫時仍未知起火時間和原因。十月下旬至十一月上旬，是慶祝排燈節的日子。這是印度教及南亞族群的重要傳統節日，代表「以光明驅走黑暗、以善良戰勝邪惡」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-13-at-18.51.42-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-13-at-18.51.37-1-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-13-at-18.51.36-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-13-at-18.51.41-1-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-13-at-18.51.44-2-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Image-2026-11-13-at-18.51.48-3-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Payme-500x237.png\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T14:43:18.414723+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":7,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T11:50:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026